    <comment>New package photon-node 0.3.4 (noarch): the photon image-processing library compiled to WebAssembly with the distribution's rust and wasm-bindgen, plus the Node.js glue, as the @silvia-odwyer/photon-node npm package ships it. opencode builds against it.
